# slideshow v1: fork-per-case probes of operations on an empty or not yet configured slideshow; none may crash (CORE).
create ss slideshow
isolate media ss next
isolate media ss previous
isolate media ss stop
isolate media ss restart
isolate media ss play
isolate tick 1 3
isolate render ss
isolate props ss
isolate missing ss
isolate state ss
tick 0.016
isolate media ss next
isolate media ss previous
isolate hotkey ss SlideShow.NextSlide 1
isolate render ss
isolate tick 5 4
isolate update ss {"files":[{"value":"/nonexistent"}],"randomize":true,"playback_mode":"random"}
isolate destroy ss
